<title>USA: Detroit $263 mln deal repriced, yields raised.</title>
<headline>Detroit $263 mln deal repriced, yields raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Painewebber Inc. said Thursday it repriced Detroit, Mich., $263 million bond deal, raising the top yield to 5.53 percent up two basis points also raising the yield in the 2022 maturity two basis points to 5.51 percent.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:  </p>
<p>CITY OF DETROIT, MICHIGAN</p>
<p>RE: $262,694,128.05*</p>
<p>SEWAGE DISPOSAL SYSTEM REVENUE BONDS</p>
<p>SERIES 1997-A</p>
<p>PLEASE NOTE REPRICING AND RESTRUCTURING.</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD.</p>
<p>THE ACCOUNT IS CLOSED.</p>
<p>ALLOTMENTS WILL BE AVAILABLE TOMORROW, FRIDAY, JUNE 20, 1997.</p>
